{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIGGER: GALACTIC TREASURES</strong> is an atmospheric space game about exploration and the hunt for ancient artifacts in the farthest reaches of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604430/extras/61b7a501a3654a535cdeb8f644e5704e.poster.avif?t=1770459852\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604430/extras/61b7a501a3654a535cdeb8f644e5704e.webm?t=1770459852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604430/extras/61b7a501a3654a535cdeb8f644e5704e.mp4?t=1770459852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, humanity has spread across the galaxy in search of resources and new worlds. However, habitable planets are exceedingly rare. The galaxy is controlled by the megacorporation <strong>GRAVEX Inc.</strong>, ruthlessly exploiting the labor of miners and treasure hunters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary worker who has inherited a decommissioned, semi-dismantled ship from your grandfather\u2014a former GRAVEX researcher. Along with the ship, you discover a notebook containing coordinates of treasures and fragments of the mysterious artifact known as the <strong>&quot;Heart of the Void&quot;</strong>, an ancient device rumored to generate matter and create habitable worlds. But the corporation is also on its trail...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604430/extras/aae6f9b59c71696610bce49c52bd883d.poster.avif?t=1770459852\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604430/extras/aae6f9b59c71696610bce49c52bd883d.webm?t=1770459852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604430/extras/aae6f9b59c71696610bce49c52bd883d.mp4?t=1770459852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exhilarating space adventure:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 Explore asteroids and forgotten planets<br>\u26cf\ufe0f Mine rare resources and minerals<br>\u2699\ufe0f Upgrade your equipment, tools, and ship<br>\ud83e\udded Discover treasures and rare artifacts from ancient civilizations<br>\ud83e\udde9 Assemble all fragments of the &quot;Heart of the Void&quot; to unveil a secret that could change the fate of all humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy is full of mysteries, and only you can uncover them!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Fresh Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604430/cfb69105b0e96c745b3846940bf7d760477ab32f.jpg"},{"name":"Now We're Talking ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604430/4c2f81997f43fba7159b148b9e86bc412ba87340.jpg"},{"name":"Clicking Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604430/e9edd4a602e9cfc086044a055ce039b01b471636.jpg"},{"name":"Finally, Some Comfort","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604430/ee754aad397e22aedde67cfd5045558eb76920cd.jpg"},{"name":"My drill is the drill that will pierce the heavens!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604430/fe647c7dfd6193ac272784c5155b7739fdcc437b.jpg"},{"name":"Nuclear Winter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3604430/a80c239c45c2d20ad41a43760188ed88fda4e9af.jpg"},{"name":"Luxury? I Earned It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im